    <a href="/">Blog</a>
    <span>›</span>
    <a href="/?cat=deliverability">Deliverability</a>
    <span>›</span>
    Why Your Emails Are Going to Spam
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ ARTICLE HEADER ════════════════════════════════════ -->
<header class="article-header">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="article-header__cat">Deliverability</span>
    <h1>Why Your Emails Are Going to Spam (And the 7-Step Fix That Actually Works)</h1>
    <p class="article-header__intro">Most deliverability advice is vague. "Warm up your IP." "Clean your list." "Authenticate your domain." None of it tells you how to diagnose which specific issue is killing your inbox placement — or in what order to fix them. This is that guide.</p>
